 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "At campaign headquarters, mayoral candidate Pavel Osipenko sits in total despair, believing that his election campaign is already doomed. Campaign aide Slava enters the office with surprising new polling figures that completely reverse the situation.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Можно войти, Павел?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Какая у нас сейчас ситуация?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Мы сейчас в полной яме.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Я бы так не сказал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Ваш рейтинг снова резко растёт вверх!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это твои глупые шутки?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Нет, это не шутки.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Люди отвернулись от Самсонова.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Они думают, что он продался.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Отношение народа к губернатору очень плохое.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Встреча подорвала доверие к Самсонову.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "По последним данным, ваш рейтинг выше.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Рейтинги поднялись на семь процентов!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Да! Это отличная новость!",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's examine how sudden political fortunes shift Osipenko from gloom to triumph.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Можно войти, Павел?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'May I come in, Pavel?' A standard polite question asking permission to enter an office.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Какая у нас сейчас ситуация?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What is our situation right now?' Osipenko asks for a realistic summary of the campaign status.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Мы сейчас в полной яме.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We are in a complete pit right now.' A descriptive idiom conveying total political ruin.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Я бы так не сказал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I would not say that.' A mild conditional phrase softening a direct contradiction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Ваш рейтинг снова резко растёт вверх!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Your rating is sharply rising again!' The adverbial combination indicates rapid growth in poll numbers.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это твои глупые шутки?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Are these your silly jokes?' Osipenko cannot believe good news and suspects mockery.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Нет, это не шутки.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, these are not jokes.' A firm statement confirming the factual truth of the poll results.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Люди отвернулись от Самсонова.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'People turned away from Samsonov.' A figurative verb showing voters deserting a political candidate.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Они думают, что он продался.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'They think that he sold out.' The colloquial verb expresses the belief that someone compromised their integrity.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Отношение народа к губернатору очень плохое.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The people's attitude toward the governor is very bad.' A clear assessment of general public sentiment.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Встреча подорвала доверие к Самсонову.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The meeting undermined trust in Samsonov.' A transitive past verb expressing the destruction of credibility.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "По последним данным, ваш рейтинг выше.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'According to latest data, your rating is higher.' A comparative adjective showing electoral advantage.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "slava",
   "t": "Рейтинги поднялись на семь процентов!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Ratings have risen by seven percent!' A specific numerical increase marking significant momentum.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Да! Это отличная новость!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
